# Wave W17-Q (Route 123): master sand — berry-bend sand: a warm bright sand running the south bend between the fields, berry-stain flecks rare in the tread where the harvest carts pass (design-authorised: a clear connected path of pale sand running end to end, the Lilac river country to the Pyre shore). Split from Route 121’s cove-road sand by brightness: the berry bend is the sunniest road under the mountain.
